{"ref":"BDB, חַוָּה²","hw":"חַוָּה²","html":"† II. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חַוָּה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. tent-village</strong>—Pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַוֹּתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 32:41\" href=\"/Numbers.32.41\">Nu 32:41</a> (JE), cf. Di. Elsewhere in cpd. appellative, almost = n.pr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַוֹּת יָאִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.14\">Dt 3:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:30\" href=\"/Joshua.13.30\">Jos 13:30</a> (D), <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:4\" href=\"/Judges.10.4\">Ju 10:4</a> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:13\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.13\">1 K 4:13</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 2:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.2.23\">1 Ch 2:23</a>.—i. <span dir=\"rtl\">חַוָּה</span> n.pr.f. v. supr.","next":"BDB, חִוִּי","prev":"BDB, חוה²"}